        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.655,
            0.833,
            0.682
          ],
          "content": "Try adding ${ \\frac { 4 } { 7 } } + { \\frac { 6 } { 7 } }$ using a number line. Do you get the same answer?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.705,
            0.834,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": "**Adding fractions with different fractional units or denominators**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.76,
            0.501,
            0.789
          ],
          "content": "**Example**: Find the sum of $\\frac { 1 } { 4 }$ and ${ \\frac { 1 } { 3 } } .$"
        },
        {
